 ('Rite Aid (2025). Pharmacy Closure and Transfer List. Internet Archive capture October 4, 2025; 1,025 national rows.', 'https://web.archive.org/web/20251004155916/https://content.riteaid.com/new-pharmacy-location.html'),
 ('Keystone First VIP Choice (2025). Pharmacy Directory. Updated May 5, 2025. Philadelphia Rite Aid entries, printed pages 105–108.', 'https://q1.keystonefirstvipchoice.com/content/dam/keystone-first/vip-choice/pdf/2025-pharmacy-directory.pdf.coredownload.inline.pdf'),
